    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Use the [`alwaysDiscardsLateVideoFrames`](avcapturevideodataoutput/alwaysdiscardslatevideoframes.md) property of [`AVCaptureVideoDataOutput`](avcapturevideodataoutput.md) or the [`alwaysDiscardsLateDepthData`](avcapturedepthdataoutput/alwaysdiscardslatedepthdata.md) property of [`AVCaptureDepthDataOutput`](avcapturedepthdataoutput.md) to choose whether the capture output discards data.",
      "ko": "`AVCaptureVideoDataOutput`의 [`alwaysDiscardsLateVideoFrames`](avcapturevideodataoutput/alwaysdiscardslatevideoframes.md) 속성 또는 `AVCaptureDepthDataOutput`의 [`alwaysDiscardsLateDepthData`](avcapturedepthdataoutput/alwaysdiscardslatedepthdata.md) 속성을 사용해 capture output이 데이터를 버릴지 여부를 선택합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "cd1bb511656af3fc115df3db6c15142169adac96b4d2c128d4b5d6c0cd43b4d1",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
